# Sarvam saarika:v2.5 doesn't support prompts, so we post-process common mishears
# of Chennai locality names. Keys are lowercase; matching is case-insensitive.
# Only triggers on EXACT match of the entire transcript (after lowercasing+stripping)
# so it won't corrupt longer sentences that happen to contain these tokens.
